         text="Bajamonte Tiepolo and the Querini led an armed rising against the doge. In the Merceria a woman dropped a stone mortar from her window, killing the rebels' standard-bearer; the column broke and fled back over the Rialto, burning the timber bridge behind it. To watch for plots the Council of Ten was created, at first for a few months.",
